Description: CONTROLGUI - local Minecraft server control panel
 Web panel (Node.js, no npm dependencies) to manage real Minecraft servers:
 Vanilla, Paper, Purpur, Folia, Mohist, Forge, plus BungeeCord and Velocity
 proxies. Real-time console, resource monitoring, file manager with editor,
 players with inventory, backups, and plugin/mod install from Modrinth.
 .
 On first launch you choose how to open the panel: as a native app window
 (WebKitGTK) or in the default browser; this can be changed later in the panel
 settings. Server data is stored under ~/.local/share/controlgui. Needs a Java
 runtime to run Minecraft servers. Developed by AlexFirst.
